hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1756","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Uwaimir Aasim bin Adi key paas aaya, aur wo Bani Ajlaan ka sardaar tha, aur us ne kaha: Tum aadmi key baarey mein kya kehtey ho jo apni biwi key sath aadmi paaey. Kya wo use qatl karey aur tum use qatl karo ya wo kaisey karey? Merey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein poochho. To Aasim Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sawalon ko naapasand kya. To Uwaimir ne us se poochha aur us ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sawalon ko naapasand kya aur aib lagaaya. Uwaimir ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main baaz na aaunga yahan tak ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein poochhun. To Uwaimir aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aadmi apni biwi key sath aadmi paaey, kya wo use qatl karey aur tum use qatl karo ya wo kaisey karey? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tumhaarey aur tumhaari biwi key baarey mein Quran naazil kar diya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon ko liaan ka hukm diya jo Allah ne apni Kitaab mein kaha tha. To us ne us se liaan kya. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Agar main use rokun to main ne us par zulm kya. To us ne use talaaq di. To wo unkey baad honay walon key liye liaan karney walon mein sunnat thi. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dekho, phir agar wo kaala gahri aankhon wala badi sireen wala tairhi pindliyon wala laaey to main Uwaimir ko us par sacha key siwa nahi samajhta. Aur agar wo surkh laaey goya zakham hai to main Uwaimir ko us par jhootha key siwa nahi samajhta. To wo us sifat par laai jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Uwaimir key sach ki sifat bayan ki thi. To wo uskey baad uski maan ki taraf mansoob tha. (Bukhari: 4745). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur us se azaab hat-ta hai ke wo Allah ki chaar gawahiyaan dey) aayat."
"1757","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Hilaal bin Umayya ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas apni biwi par Shareek bin Sahmaa key sath tohmat lagai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gawaah ya tumhaari peeth par hadd! To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Jab ham mein se koi apni biwi par aadmi dekhey to kya wo gawaah talaash karney jaey? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaaney lagey: Gawaah, warna tumhaari peeth par hadd! To Hilaal ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja! Beshak main sacha hun, to Allah zaroor naazil karega jo meri peeth ko hadd se bari karega. To Jibreel naazil huey aur Aap par naazil kya: (Aur jo apni biwiyon par tohmat lagaatey hain). To Aap ne padha yahan tak ke (agar wo sachey mein se ho) tak pahunchay. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas aey aur uski taraf bheja. To Hilaal aaya aur gawahi di. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahey they: Beshak Allah jaanta hai ke tum donon mein se aik jhootha hai. To kya tum donon mein tauba karney wala hai? Phir wo khadi hui aur gawahi di. Phir jab paanchween par thi to use rokay aur kaha: Beshak wo waajib karney wali hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To wo ruki aur peechey hati yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke wo wapas aayegi. Phir us ne kaha: Main apni qaum ko saara din ruswa na karungi. To wo aagey badhi. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use dekho, phir agar wo surma lagin aankhon wala bhari sireen wala tairhi pindliyon wala laaey to wo Shareek bin Sahmaa ka hai. To wo us jaisa lai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaash Allah ki Kitaab mein jo guzar chuka hai na hota to mera aur uska muamla hota. (Bukhari: 4747). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Jo apne chehron par Jahannum ki taraf haankey jaaengey) aayat."
